{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120374","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120374/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120374/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120374/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120374","id":4685817636,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF0vnJA","number":120374,"title":"Segfaults due to stale parent scripts are not being re-compiled when a new derived script is compiled","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-06-17T18:00:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:43Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\ncurrent master @ f7fcb79c4399070be07caadfbe2304a9c94711fa, 4.6.3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.4.1) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M4 Max (Apple9) - Apple M4 Max (16 threads) - 64.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot is not checking to see if parent scripts needed to be re-compiled when compiling newer derived scripts, and this can potentially lead to segfaults due to bogus member indices.\n\nConsider the following scripts:\n\n<img width=\"1407\" height=\"760\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f7919ff-a16b-46b9-a80a-40f4aaae1cc2\" />\n<img width=\"624\" height=\"573\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4090ca2a-91ae-4ac7-a116-b1a4af89abec\" />\n\n`skippable` and `skip_abilities` were moved from `quest.gd` into a new dependent script `lore_quest.gd`. Say, during a branch checkout where `lore_quest.gd` was added and the scenes are reloaded, if a resource is loaded that has `lore_quest.gd` as its script, and `lore_quest.gd` gets compiled without `quest.gd` being re-compiled, the member indices will be incorrect:\n\n<img width=\"603\" height=\"333\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bebb54f-7faa-487f-ab91-34bd4ba2bb7d\" />\n\nThis will lead to segfaults when attempting to `get` any of the newer members:\n<img width=\"793\" height=\"246\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ff952d8-713b-4488-b047-d36c75ad847e\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Load the project up in the editor\n2. Ensure that the \"test.tscn\" scene is open in the editor\n3. Make sure the git panel is enabled by going to `Project->Version Control->Version Control Settings` and enabling `Connect to VCS` in the dialog.\n4. Go to the `Commit` dock, check out the `lore_quest` branch\n5. Observe crash\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[script-compile-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29060394/script-compile-mrp.zip)\n\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120374/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120374/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}